# Copy to .env for local development. Never commit .env.
# Only PUBLIC values belong here (anything prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ ships inside the app).
# The first release is local-only, so no cloud keys are needed yet.
# Phase 7 (optional cloud sync) would add:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# NEVER put a Supabase service-role key in this app.
